        <p>
          <a href="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL">Email</a> | <a href="YOUR-LINKEDIN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a> | <a href="YOUR-GITHUB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> | <a href="/files/aee_resume_2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Résumé</a>
